        "All 11 ACs are met. Implementation spans config.js (renderPersonaModelsTab, pmBuildTabHtml, pmWireEvents, pmDoSave, pmDoRebuild), styles.css (Persona Models CSS + .spinner), and server.ts (rebuild failure path). No outstanding issues. Proceed to code review."
